# Objective

Detect privileged remote network authentication associated with SMB administrative access between Windows systems.

DET-006 focuses on the behavioral combination:

```text
Remote Source
      +
Successful Network Logon
      +
Privileged Account
      +
SMB Administrative Access
```

The detection does not assume that all SMB administration is malicious.

It provides a high-priority lateral-movement investigation signal.

