Review Authentication History
   |
   v
Review Target Activity
   |
   v
Correlate Other Detections
   |
   v
Determine Authorization
```

Questions:

1. Which system initiated the connection?
2. Which endpoint was accessed?
3. Which account authenticated?
4. Is the account privileged?
5. Was Logon Type 3 observed?
6. Was C$ or ADMIN$ accessed?
7. Is this source authorized for remote administration?
8. Were failed logons observed beforehand?
9. Was PowerShell executed afterward?
10. Was persistence established afterward?
11. Were privileges changed afterward?
12. Is this consistent with normal administration?

