# False Positives

Legitimate reasons include:

- Helpdesk administration
- IT maintenance
- Remote software deployment
- Backup systems
- File administration
- Endpoint management
- Administrative scripts
- Security testing

Therefore:

```text
SMB Administrative Access
        !=
Confirmed Lateral Movement
```

