```

Possible severity modifiers:

- Source not in approved admin workstation list
- Target is sensitive
- Account is highly privileged
- Access occurs outside normal change window
- Failed logons precede success
- PowerShell follows access
- Persistence follows access

---

# Detection Limitations

DET-006 currently:

- Focuses on SMB administrative access
- Depends primarily on Event 4624
- Uses lab-specific account and source context
- Does not detect every lateral-movement technique
- Does not independently prove malicious intent
- May identify legitimate administrative activity
- Requires analyst correlation

Future versions can incorporate broader host baselines and richer share telemetry.

